         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO27000:2018" ;
         rdfs:comment "measure that is modifying risk (3.61) Note 1 to entry: Controls include any process (3.54), policy (3.53), device, practice, or other actions which modify risk (3.61). Note 2 to entry: It is possible that controls not always exert the intended or assumed modifying effect."@en ;
         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
         rdfs:label "Control"@en ;
         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> :Risk ;
         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "measure that is modifying risk (3.61) Note 1 to entry: Controls include any process (3.54), policy (3.53), device, practice, or other actions which modify risk (3.61). Note 2 to entry: It is possible that controls not always exert the intended or assumed modifying effect."@en ;
         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Control"@en .


