###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#Governance
:Governance rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Junli Liang" ,
                                                   "Rob Brennan" ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-03-14"^^xsd:date ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 27002:2022(E)" ;
            rdfs:comment "A set of processes that ensures that data assets are formally managed throughout the enterprise. A data governance model establishes authority and management and decision making parameters related to the data produced or managed by the enterprise."@en ;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
            rdfs:label "Governance"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A set of processes that ensures that data assets are formally managed throughout the enterprise. A data governance model establishes authority and management and decision making parameters related to the data produced or managed by the enterprise."@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Governance"@en .


