###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#InformationFlowContext
:InformationFlowContext rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Junli Liang" ,
