             rdfs:label "Performance"@en ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> :Measurement ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "measurable result Note 1 to entry: Performance can relate either to quantitative or qualitative findings. Note 2 to entry: Performance can relate to the management of activities, processes (3.54), products (including services), systems or organizations (3.50)"@en ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Performance"@en .


###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#PhysicalSecurity
:PhysicalSecurity rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Junli Liang" ,
                                                         "Rob Brennan" ;
                  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-03-14"^^xsd:date ;
                  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO/IEC 27002:2022(E)" ;
                  rdfs:comment "A set of mutually reinforcing security controls implemented by technical, physical, and procedural means. Such controls are typically selected to achieve a common information security-related purpose."@en ;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
                  rdfs:label "Physical security"@en ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A set of mutually reinforcing security controls implemented by technical, physical, and procedural means. Such controls are typically selected to achieve a common information security-related purpose."@en ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#> ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Physical security"@en .


