                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Political environment"@en .


###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#Process
:Process rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Junli Liang" ,
